        {
          "text": "Cannot be solved",
          "why": "The equation is linear and has a unique solution."
        }
      ],
      "solution_text": "Combine the coefficients: $\\frac{3}{7}+\\frac15=\\frac{15+7}{35}=\\frac{22}{35}$. Hence $\\frac{22}{35}x=1$, so $x=\\frac{35}{22}$."
